{"name":"Bleached Meadow","hex":"#eae5d5","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bleached","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Whitened; made white using bleach","Faded or washed out by weather and strong sunlight."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of bleach"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bleached"},{"term":"meadow","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A field or pasture; a piece of land either intentionally cultivated with grass or (especially) naturally covered with grass, especially one that is intended to be mown for hay or to be grazed.","Low land covered with coarse grass or rank herbage near rivers and in marshy places by the sea."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To cultivate with grass in order to produce hay."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/meadow"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bleached","blocks":[{"text":"Bleached is an American pop band consisting of sisters Jennifer and Jessica Clavin, formerly of Mika Miko. The band plays a style of rock, pop, rock and roll, and indie rock. Bleached was established in Los Angeles in 2011. The group has released three studio albums, Ride Your Heart (2013), Welcome the Worms (2016) and Don't You Think You've Had Enough? (2019), all with Dead Oceans, and have charted on the Billboard charts."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Bleached_performing_at_The_Great_Escape%2C_May_2016.jpg/330px-Bleached_performing_at_The_Great_Escape%2C_May_2016.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleached","wikidata":"Q25056076"},{"title":"Meadow","blocks":[{"text":"A meadow is an open habitat or field, vegetated by grasses, herbs, and other non-woody plants. Trees or shrubs may sparsely populate meadows, as long as they maintain an open character. Meadows can occur naturally under favourable conditions but are often artificially created from cleared shrub or woodland for the production of hay, fodder or livestock. Meadow habitats as a group are characterized as semi-natural grasslands, meaning that they are largely composed of species native to the region, with only limited human intervention."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Blumenwiese_bei_Obermaiselstein05.jpg/330px-Blumenwiese_bei_Obermaiselstein05.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meadow","wikidata":"Q7777019"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Bleached_at_Tufnell_Park_Dome%2C_October_2013.jpg/500px-Bleached_at_Tufnell_Park_Dome%2C_October_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Bleached_at_Tufnell_Park_Dome%2C_October_2013.jpg/1280px-Bleached_at_Tufnell_Park_Dome%2C_October_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Bleached_at_Tufnell_Park_Dome%2C_October_2013.jpg/500px-Bleached_at_Tufnell_Park_Dome%2C_October_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bleached performing in London in 2013","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABleached_at_Tufnell_Park_Dome%2C_October_2013.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Jennifer_Clavin_of_Bleached_at_The_Great_Escape%2C_May_2016_%282%29.jpg/500px-Jennifer_Clavin_of_Bleached_at_The_Great_Escape%2C_May_2016_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Jennifer_Clavin_of_Bleached_at_The_Great_Escape%2C_May_2016_%282%29.jpg/1280px-Jennifer_Clavin_of_Bleached_at_The_Great_Escape%2C_May_2016_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbn